GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/4/rides

### leaderBoard
GET http://localhost:3001/api/leaderBoard


### All Routes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/routes


### NewGame
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/start


### SubmitGame (14 -> 7)
POST localhost:3001/api/game/submit
content-type: application/json

{
  "game_id": 4,
  "path": {
    "rides": [
      {"from": 14, "to": 13},
      {"from": 13, "to": 11},
      {"from": 11, "to": 10},
      {"from": 10, "to": 7}
    ]
  }
}

